meta {
  name: org
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  The single-tenant organization record and its department tree. Every
  request here requires an admin token: system_admin holds every org:* and
  department:* permission, so the same token auth/login stored covers the
  whole folder.

  Departments are created, renamed and deleted within this folder so it
  leaves nothing behind — the same discipline users/ follows for the
  account it owns.
}
